Maintainer: Thierry Gosselin <thierrygosselin@icloud.com>
Description: Tools for population-assignment analysis with genomic data,
    including marker resampling, Training-Holdout-Leave-one-out validation,
    assignment summaries, and fast implementations of common FST estimators.
